e</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li> taille <br> Vous pouvez utiliser ces mots : <span class=\"italic\">petite/grande taille, grand, petit, mince, maigre, ob\u00e8se, gros, muscl\u00e9 </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<li>apparence g\u00e9n\u00e9rale <br>  Vous pouvez utiliser ces mots : <span class=\"italic\">beau/belle, mal/bien habill\u00e9, jeune, vieux, vieille, d'un certain \u00e2ge, etc. </span>  </li></ul>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la t\u00eate remplie", "type": "name"}, {"content": "quand on pense \u00e0 beaucoup de choses", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'ai la t\u00eate remplie d'histoires de fant\u00f4mes !", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots qu'on utilise pour raconter une histoire.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "\u00eatre tout ou\u00efe", "type": "name"}, {"content": "\u00eatre pr\u00eat \u00e0 \u00e9couter", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je suis tout ou\u00efe !", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la tentative d'assassinat", "type": "name"}, {"content": "essayer de tuer quelqu'un", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Elle a \u00e9t\u00e9 arr\u00eat\u00e9e pour tentative d'assassinat contre L\u00e9nine. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hanter", "type": "name"}, {"content": "revenir de la mort sous forme de fant\u00f4me pour se manifester aux vivants", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Alors son fant\u00f4me hante les <br/>tours ?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "oh mes a\u00efeux", "type": "name"}, {"content": " expression de surprise ou de peur", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Oh mes a\u00efeux ! Je crois que j'ai entendu quelque chose !", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "errer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "marcher sans direction", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : C'est l'histoire du fant\u00f4me d'une jeune femme qui erre dans les tours.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l'apparition", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une manifestation soudaine", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : On signale de nombreuses apparitions d'une femme au visage p\u00e2le qui erre dans le b\u00e2timent.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le fusil", "type": "name"}, {"content": "pistolet ; une arme \u00e0 feu", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Certains disent qu'on l'a vue tenant un fusil et qu'elle semblait trembler.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "trembler", "type": "name"}, {"content": "fr\u00e9mir de froid, de peur, etc.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Laura tremblait de froid : elle avait encore oubli\u00e9 son manteau.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le03ob03aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"con